RIX B860-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Gold\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.profesionalreview.com/2025/01/13/asus-rog-strix-b860-f-gaming-wifi-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/201911212011036520861.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"DDs Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.ddworld.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>DDs Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      If you are looking for a quality, well-equipped Intel B860 board for Core Ultra 200 processors, then ASUS and its ROG STRIX B860-F Gaming WIFI is a relatively clear choice, because you simply won't find anything better, if anything, in the B860 motherboard range. It has the maximum possible equipment and top-notch workmanship.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>01/16/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B860-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of DDs Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://www.ddworld.cz/pc-a-komponenty/zakladni-desky/intel-b860-v-akci-test-a-recenze-asus-rog-strix-b860-f-gaming-wifi-zakladni-desky-4.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\